# Defect 016's map shape (panel 230's R2, M-panic-location step 10): an `assert`
# on two maps wrote its expression and no side, until the sides were written as
# the specification writes the values, in the lldb formatter's notation and
# within its bounds. The line checked is the one that shows the shape.
# A map's entries stand in the order of their whole text, never the buckets'.

function main()
    ages = {"zeta": 1, "alpha": 2, "mid": 3}
    one = {"alpha": 2}
    assert ages == one
